            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'm going to do a `QuitPre` hook to temporarily set `buftype=help` to skirt around this.  That way the buffer(s) don't stay as help windows for long enough to become a problem, but they can still hide from the exit logic while that's going on.",
